    "preamble": "Tata Consumer Products Limited vs Food Safety And Standards Authority Of ... on 8 July, 2024 Author: Sanjeev Narula Bench: Sanjeev Narula $~53 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 1428/2023 Tata Consumer Products Limited Th ve Food Safety And Standards Authority Of I Through: Mr. Rakesh Chaudha Advocates for Fssa Ms. Malvika Trived with Ms. Niharika Shailendra Slaria, Impleader Ms. Ranu Purohit, Intervenor Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Sanjeev Narula Or % 08.07.2024 1. Through this application, the Petitioner requests for a change of a date in the present petition.",
